有灵，吾百年之后何恨哉！”遂至浚仪〖11〗，治睢阳渠〖12〗；遣使以太牢祀桥玄〖13〗。﹝一﹞进军官渡。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
